<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuoni boosts 1996 net 53.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Kuoni boosts 1996 net 53.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			69.4		vs 45.2</p>
<p> Oper profit (EBIT)	   77.2		vs 59.4</p>
<p> Revenues			 3,514	     vs 2,916</p>
<p> Dividend, proposed (Sfr)   70		  vs 35</p>
<p> Jubilee bonus (Sfr)	  0		   vs 10</p>
<p>NOTE - Swiss travel and tour group Kuoni Reisen AG said all four of its strategic buisness units were profitable in 1996 -- Switzerland, International, Incoming and Britain.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
